  "id": "output",
  "term": "output",
  "definition": "In this context, output means the observable or measurable result of performance, such as the acoustic sound produced in singing. The source contrasts output with the broader learning process, emphasizing that singing involves bodily, expressive, and developmental learning that cannot be understood only through measurable results.",
